{%- comment -%}
  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
  ║  SECTION: collection-kyota.liquid                           ║
  ║  Template: templates/collection.kyota.json                  ║
  ║  Collection handle: kyota                                   ║
  ║                                                              ║
  ║  HOW TO INSTALL:                                             ║
  ║  1. Upload this file to /sections/collection-kyota.liquid    ║
  ║  2. Upload templates/collection.kyota.json                   ║
  ║  3. (Optional) Add product metafields:                       ║
  ║     - custom.badge         → string (e.g. "Flagship","AI")  ║
  ║     - custom.badge_class   → string ("gold","flagship","")  ║
  ║     - custom.buyer_for     → string (e.g. "AI Precision")   ║
  ║     - custom.key_features  → list of strings (JSON array)   ║
  ║     - custom.model_headline → string                        ║
  ║     - custom.model_description → string (up to 400 chars)   ║
  ║     - custom.tradeoff      → string                         ║
  ║  4. Tag products with: genki, yugana, hatsumei, nokori,     ║
  ║     joubu, 4d, ai, syner-d, flagship, entry-premium         ║
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- paginate collection.products by 50 -%}

{%- comment -%} ── SCHEMA MARKUP ── {%- endcomment -%}
