      {"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Kyota massage chair?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The best Kyota depends on your needs. For daily ease and calf relief: Genki M380. For 4D premium daily use: Yugana M780. For AI-guided personalization: Hatsumei M900. For a powerful 4D experience: Joubu M880. For flagship premium buyers: Nokori M980 Syner-D."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Are Kyota massage chairs good?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Kyota massage chairs are well-regarded for their clear model progression, strong calf and foot relief, 4D roller technology in premium models, and AI-guided body scanning in the Hatsumei M900. They represent genuine premium value at their respective price tiers."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Can I try Kyota massage chairs in person?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries Kyota models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and at our Pleasanton location at Stoneridge Shopping Center. We strongly recommend an in-person visit — Kyota's calf work, 4D rollers, and body scan feel must be experienced firsthand."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I buy authentic Kyota massage chairs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"House of Massage Chairs is an authorized Kyota dealer with showrooms in San Jose and Pleasanton, CA. Buying from an authorized specialist ensures genuine products, valid manufacturer warranties, and professional setup support."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between Kyota models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Genki M380 is an accessible daily-use entry. The Yugana M780 adds 4D technology and full-feature depth. The Hatsumei M900 adds AI-guided personalization. The Joubu M880 delivers strong 4D performance. The Nokori M980 Syner-D is Kyota's flagship with the most premium presence and Syner-D dual-roller technology."}}
    ]
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "name": "Kyota Massage Chairs Collection",
    "url": "{{ shop.url }}/collections/kyota",
    "numberOfItems": {{ collection.products_count }},
    "itemListElement": [
      {%- for product in collection.products -%}
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": {{ forloop.index }},
        "name": {{ product.title | json }},
        "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}",
        "offers": {
          "@type": "Offer",
          "priceCurrency": "USD",
          "price": "{{ product.price | money_without_currency }}",
          "availability": "{% if product.available %}https://schema.org/InStock{% else %}https://schema.org/OutOfStock{% endif %}"
        }
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  }
]
</script>

<style>
  :root {
    --kyo-bg: #fff;
    --kyo-surface: #f8fafc;
    --kyo-surface2: #f1f5f9;
    --kyo-dark: #000;
    --kyo-muted: #555;
    --kyo-muted2: #888;
    --kyo-accent: #b38b4d;
    --kyo-accent-h: #96723e;
    --kyo-accent-pale: rgba(179,139,77,0.10);
    --kyo-accent-pale2: rgba(179,139,77,0.06);
    --kyo-border: #e5e9f0;
    --kyo-border2: #d0d8e4;
    --kyo-radius: 20px;
    --kyo-radius-sm: 12px;
    --kyo-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    --kyo-shadow-hover: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.11);
  }

  .kyo-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  .kyo-wrap{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--kyo-dark);line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .kyo-wrap p{font-size:15px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.8}
  .kyo-wrap li{font-size:14px}
  .kyo-wrap h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px)}
  .kyo-wrap h3{font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px)}
  .kyo-wrap h4{font-size:16px}
  .kyo-wrap h1,.kyo-wrap h2,.kyo-wrap h3,.kyo-wrap h4{line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em}
  .kyo-wrap img{max-width:100%;display:block}

  .kyo-container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}
  .kyo-container-narrow{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}

  /* SUBNAV */
  .kyo-subnav{background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}
  .kyo-subnav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .kyo-subnav-inner{display:flex;padding:0 32px;min-width:max-content}
  .kyo-subnav-inner a{display:block;padding:12px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kyo-muted2);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;transition:all .2s;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-subnav-inner a:hover,.kyo-subnav-inner a.active{color:var(--kyo-dark);border-bottom-color:var(--kyo-accent)}

  /* BUTTONS */
  .kyo-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;background:var(--kyo-dark);color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50px;transition:all .25s;border:2px solid var(--kyo-dark);cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.01em;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-btn:hover{background:#222;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
  .kyo-btn-gold{background:var(--kyo-accent);border-color:var(--kyo-accent);color:#fff!important}
  .kyo-btn-gold:hover{background:var(--kyo-accent-h);border-color:var(--kyo-accent-h);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(179,139,77,.3)}
  .kyo-btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--kyo-dark);border-color:var(--kyo-border2)}
  .kyo-btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--kyo-dark);background:var(--kyo-surface)}
  .kyo-btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35)}
  .kyo-btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}
  .kyo-btn-sm{padding:10px 24px;font-size:14px}

  /* HERO */
  .kyo-hero{position:relative;min-height:84vh;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:#060608}
  .kyo-hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url({% if section.settings.hero_image %}{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}{% else %}https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0649/9516/4367/files/kyota-massage-chair-luxury.jpg?v=1776368241{% endif %});background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:.30;z-index:0;transition:transform 8s ease}
  .kyo-hero-grad{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(115deg,rgba(0,0,0,.95) 28%,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 65%,rgba(10,8,4,.8) 100%);z-index:1}
  .kyo-hero-shimmer{position:absolute;top:-10%;right:-8%;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(179,139,77,.07) 0%,transparent 70%);z-index:2;pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-hero-content{position:relative;z-index:3;padding:80px 0 88px}
  .kyo-hero-bc{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);margin-bottom:24px}
  .kyo-hero-bc a{color:var(--kyo-accent);transition:color .2s;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-hero-bc a:hover{color:#fff}
  .kyo-hero-bc span{margin:0 6px}
  .kyo-hero-eye{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--kyo-accent);margin-bottom:20px;background:rgba(179,139,77,.1);padding:5px 14px;border-radius:50px;border:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.18)}
  .kyo-hero-eye::before{content:'●';font-size:7px;animation:kyoPulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes kyoPulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.5;transform:scale(1.5)}}
  .kyo-hero h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,62px);color:#fff;max-width:780px;margin-bottom:20px;text-shadow:0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);line-height:1.1}
  .kyo-hero-lead{font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);max-width:620px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.65}
  .kyo-hero-sub{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);max-width:580px;margin-bottom:40px;line-height:1.8}
  .kyo-hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:48px}
  .kyo-hero-stats{display:flex;gap:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding-top:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .kyo-hero-stat{padding:0 40px 0 0;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);margin-right:40px}
  .kyo-hero-stat:last-child{border-right:none;margin-right:0}
  .kyo-hero-stat-n{font-size:32px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  .kyo-hero-stat-l{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700}

  /* TRUST BAR */
  .kyo-trust-bar{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:48px;padding:20px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);background:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .kyo-trust-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--kyo-muted)}
  .kyo-trust-item svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:var(--kyo-accent);flex-shrink:0}

  /* SECTIONS */
  .kyo-section{padding:88px 0}
  .kyo-section-alt{background:var(--kyo-surface)}
  .kyo-section-sm{padding:56px 0}
  .kyo-section-label{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--kyo-accent);margin-bottom:14px}
  .kyo-section-header{margin-bottom:48px}
  .kyo-section-header.center{text-align:center}
  .kyo-section-header.center .kyo-section-label{display:block}
  .kyo-section-header h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);margin-bottom:14px}
  .kyo-underline{position:relative;display:inline-block}
  .kyo-underline::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-4px;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--kyo-accent);border-radius:2px}
  .kyo-section-header p{font-size:17px;color:var(--kyo-muted);max-width:680px;line-height:1.8}
  .kyo-section-header.center p{margin:0 auto}

  /* PRODUCT SECTION */
  .kyo-product-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#040406 0%,#130e06 60%,#080808 100%);padding:48px 48px 0;border-radius:var(--kyo-radius) var(--kyo-radius) 0 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-product-header::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40%;right:-10%;width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(179,139,77,.06) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-product-header-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px;padding-bottom:40px}
  .kyo-product-header h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(24px,2.5vw,32px)}
  .kyo-product-header p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-size:14px;max-width:560px;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.7}

  /* FILTER BAR */
  .kyo-filter-bar{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-top:none;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .kyo-filter-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--kyo-muted2);white-space:nowrap}
  .kyo-filter-sep{width:1px;height:20px;background:var(--kyo-border);flex-shrink:0}
  .kyo-filter-btn{padding:6px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;background:transparent;color:var(--kyo-muted);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}
  .kyo-filter-btn:hover{border-color:var(--kyo-accent);color:var(--kyo-accent);background:var(--kyo-accent-pale2)}
  .kyo-filter-btn.active{background:var(--kyo-dark);color:#fff;border-color:var(--kyo-dark)}
  .kyo-filter-count{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--kyo-muted2);font-weight:600}

  /* PRODUCT GRID */
  .kyo-product-grid-wrap{background:var(--kyo-surface);border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 var(--kyo-radius) var(--kyo-radius);padding:32px}
  .kyo-product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}

  /* PRODUCT CARD */
  .kyo-product-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);overflow:hidden;transition:all .3s cubic-bezier(.25,.8,.25,1);position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .kyo-product-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow-hover);border-color:transparent;outline:2px solid var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-product-badge{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;background:var(--kyo-dark);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:50px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;z-index:2}
  .kyo-product-badge.gold{background:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-product-badge.flagship{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#09060f,#1e1000);border:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.35)}
  .kyo-product-img-wrap{height:240px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fafafa,#fff);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-product-img-wrap::before{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:60px;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(248,250,252,.8),transparent);pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-product-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;mix-blend-mode:multiply;transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.25,.8,.25,1)}
  .kyo-product-card:hover .kyo-product-img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .kyo-product-body{padding:18px 20px 20px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .kyo-product-for{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--kyo-accent);background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);display:inline-block;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .kyo-product-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--kyo-dark)}
  .kyo-product-name a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-product-feats{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 14px;flex:1}
  .kyo-product-feats li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:5px;font-size:13px;color:var(--kyo-muted);padding:2.5px 0;line-height:1.5}
  .kyo-product-feats li::before{content:'✓';color:var(--kyo-accent);font-weight:900;font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
  .kyo-product-prices{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:7px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .kyo-price-sale{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:var(--kyo-dark);letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .kyo-price-was{font-size:13px;color:#adb5bd;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:500}
  .kyo-price-save{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;background:rgba(22,163,74,.08);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px}
  .kyo-product-cta{display:block;text-align:center;background:var(--kyo-dark);color:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--kyo-radius-sm);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;transition:background .2s;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-product-cta:hover{background:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-no-results{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:64px 0;color:var(--kyo-muted)}

  /* QUICK ANSWER */
  .kyo-quick-answer{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#040406 0%,#16100a 100%);border-radius:24px;padding:48px;border:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.12);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-quick-answer::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-30%;right:-5%;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(179,139,77,.055) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-qa-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:32px;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .kyo-qa-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;transition:all .3s}
  .kyo-qa-item:hover{background:rgba(179,139,77,.07);border-color:rgba(179,139,77,.2)}
  .kyo-qa-item h3{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--kyo-accent);margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:800}
  .kyo-qa-item p{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);line-height:1.78;margin:0}

  /* PILLARS */
  .kyo-pillar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
  .kyo-pillar-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:32px;transition:all .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-pillar-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--kyo-accent);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s}
  .kyo-pillar-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow)}
  .kyo-pillar-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
  .kyo-pillar-icon{width:48px;height:48px;background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px}
  .kyo-pillar-icon svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-pillar-card h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .kyo-pillar-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.75}

  /* AT A GLANCE */
  .kyo-glance-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start}
  .kyo-glance-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
  .kyo-glance-table tr{border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border)}
  .kyo-glance-table tr:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .kyo-glance-table td{padding:14px 8px;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top}
  .kyo-glance-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--kyo-dark);width:38%}
  .kyo-glance-table td:last-child{color:var(--kyo-muted)}
  .kyo-glance-verdict{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#060608,#14100a);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:36px;border:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.1)}
  .kyo-glance-verdict h3{color:#fff;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .kyo-verdict-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
  .kyo-verdict-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0}
  .kyo-verdict-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kyo-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:8px}
  .kyo-verdict-item p{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin:0;line-height:1.7}

  /* WHO IT'S FOR */
  .kyo-for-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}
  .kyo-for-card{border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);background:#fff}
  .kyo-for-card.alt{background:var(--kyo-surface)}
  .kyo-for-badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:50px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px}
  .kyo-for-badge.yes{background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);color:#16a34a}
  .kyo-for-badge.no{background:rgba(239,68,68,.08);color:#dc2626}
  .kyo-for-list{list-style:none;padding:0}
  .kyo-for-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .kyo-for-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .kyo-for-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:7px}
  .kyo-for-dot.yes{background:#16a34a}
  .kyo-for-dot.no{background:#dc2626}

  /* MODEL ENTRIES */
  .kyo-model-entry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);background:#fff;margin-bottom:32px;transition:box-shadow .3s}
  .kyo-model-entry:hover{box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow-hover)}
  .kyo-model-side{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#060608,#16100a);padding:36px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
  .kyo-model-side-imgbox{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:12px 0 8px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:200px;max-height:240px}
  .kyo-model-side-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;mix-blend-mode:multiply;transition:transform .4s ease}
  .kyo-model-entry:hover .kyo-model-side-img{transform:scale(1.07)}
  .kyo-model-tier{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--kyo-accent);margin-bottom:6px}
  .kyo-model-side h3{color:#fff;font-size:16px;line-height:1.3}
  .kyo-model-side p{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);line-height:1.65;margin-top:6px}
  .kyo-model-price-band{display:inline-flex;gap:5px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .kyo-model-price-band span{color:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-model-body{padding:36px}
  .kyo-model-best{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--kyo-accent);background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .kyo-model-body h4{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .kyo-model-body p{font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.78;margin-bottom:14px}
  .kyo-model-traits{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}
  .kyo-trait{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--kyo-surface2);border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);color:var(--kyo-muted2)}
  .kyo-model-tradeoff{margin-top:16px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--kyo-surface);border-left:3px solid var(--kyo-border2);font-size:13px;color:var(--kyo-muted2);line-height:1.65}
  .kyo-model-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kyo-accent);margin-top:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.3);padding-bottom:2px;transition:all .2s;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-model-link:hover{gap:9px;border-bottom-color:var(--kyo-accent)}

  /* BUYER TYPES */
  .kyo-buyer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}
  .kyo-buyer-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:28px;transition:all .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-buyer-card:hover{border-color:rgba(179,139,77,.3);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(179,139,77,.1)}
  .kyo-buyer-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kyo-accent),transparent);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s}
  .kyo-buyer-card:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
  .kyo-buyer-icon{width:42px;height:42px;background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px}
  .kyo-buyer-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-buyer-type{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--kyo-muted2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:6px}
  .kyo-buyer-card h3{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .kyo-buyer-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--kyo-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.7}
  .kyo-buyer-rec{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kyo-accent)}

  /* COMPARE TABLE */
  .kyo-compare-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border)}
  .kyo-compare-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;min-width:700px}
  .kyo-compare-table th{background:var(--kyo-dark);color:#fff;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em}
  .kyo-compare-table td{padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);color:var(--kyo-muted);vertical-align:middle}
  .kyo-compare-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  .kyo-compare-table tr:hover td{background:var(--kyo-surface)}
  .kyo-col-feature{font-weight:800;color:var(--kyo-dark)!important;white-space:nowrap}
  .kyo-kyo-col{background:rgba(179,139,77,.04)!important}
  thead .kyo-kyo-col{background:rgba(179,139,77,.13)!important;color:var(--kyo-accent)!important;border-bottom:3px solid var(--kyo-accent)!important}
  .kyo-check{color:var(--kyo-accent);font-weight:800}

  /* EXPERT CALLOUT */
  .kyo-expert-callout{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-left:4px solid var(--kyo-accent);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:24px 28px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px}
  .kyo-expert-callout svg{width:26px;height:26px;fill:var(--kyo-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}
  .kyo-expert-callout p{font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.78;margin:0}
  .kyo-expert-callout strong{color:var(--kyo-dark)}

  /* PRICE LADDER */
  .kyo-price-ladder{border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-price-rung{display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);transition:background .2s}
  .kyo-price-rung:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .kyo-price-rung:hover{background:var(--kyo-surface)}
  .kyo-price-rung-label{background:var(--kyo-dark);padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
  .kyo-price-tier-name{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px}
  .kyo-price-amount{font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--kyo-accent);letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .kyo-price-rung-body{padding:24px 32px}
  .kyo-price-rung-body h4{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .kyo-price-rung-body p{font-size:13px;color:var(--kyo-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.65}
  .kyo-price-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
  .kyo-price-tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);color:var(--kyo-accent)}

  /* TRUST CARDS */
  .kyo-trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
  .kyo-trust-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:28px;transition:all .3s}
  .kyo-trust-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow)}
  .kyo-trust-card-icon{width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px}
  .kyo-trust-card-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-trust-card h3{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .kyo-trust-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.75}

  /* REVIEWS */
  .kyo-review-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
  .kyo-review-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);padding:28px;transition:all .3s;position:relative}
  .kyo-review-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow)}
  .kyo-review-card::before{content:'"';position:absolute;top:16px;right:20px;font-size:64px;color:var(--kyo-accent-pale);font-weight:900;line-height:1;pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-review-stars{color:var(--kyo-accent);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .kyo-review-text{font-size:14px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.78;margin-bottom:18px;font-style:italic}
  .kyo-review-author{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .kyo-review-avatar{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
  .kyo-review-name{font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
  .kyo-review-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--kyo-muted2)}

  /* SHOWROOM */
  .kyo-showroom-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}
  .kyo-showroom-card{border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:var(--kyo-radius);overflow:hidden;transition:all .3s}
  .kyo-showroom-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--kyo-shadow-hover)}
  .kyo-showroom-head{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#060608,#16100a);padding:32px 36px 28px}
  .kyo-showroom-pill{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--kyo-accent);background:rgba(179,139,77,.14);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.18)}
  .kyo-showroom-head h3{color:#fff;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:5px}
  .kyo-showroom-head p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.48);font-size:13px;margin:0}
  .kyo-showroom-body{background:#fff;padding:28px 36px}
  .kyo-showroom-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border);font-size:13px}
  .kyo-showroom-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .kyo-showroom-row svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:var(--kyo-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
  .kyo-showroom-btns{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .kyo-final-cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#040406 0%,#16100a 55%,#040406 100%);border-radius:28px;padding:64px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .kyo-final-cta::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40%;right:-8%;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(179,139,77,.08) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-final-cta::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-30%;left:-5%;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(179,139,77,.05) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .kyo-final-cta-inner{position:relative;z-index:1}
  .kyo-final-cta h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,42px);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.12}
  .kyo-final-cta p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.62);font-size:16px;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:32px;line-height:1.78}
  .kyo-cta-points{display:flex;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:32px}
  .kyo-cta-point{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .kyo-cta-point svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:var(--kyo-accent);flex-shrink:0}
  .kyo-cta-point span{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.58);font-weight:600}
  .kyo-final-cta-btns{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}

  /* ANSWER BLOCKS */
  .kyo-answer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}
  .kyo-answer-block{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:14px;padding:28px;transition:all .3s}
  .kyo-answer-block:hover{border-color:var(--kyo-border2);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
  .kyo-answer-block h3{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .kyo-answer-block p{font-size:13px;color:var(--kyo-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.78}

  /* FAQ */
  .kyo-faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--kyo-border)}
  .kyo-faq-q{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 0;cursor:pointer;gap:16px}
  .kyo-faq-q h3{font-size:16px;margin:0;font-weight:700;transition:color .2s;line-height:1.4}
  .kyo-faq-q:hover h3{color:var(--kyo-accent)}
  .kyo-faq-icon{width:22px;height:22px;fill:var(--kyo-muted2);flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .3s}
  .kyo-faq-q.active .kyo-faq-icon{transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .kyo-faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease}
  .kyo-faq-a.open{max-height:600px}
  .kyo-faq-a p{margin:0;padding-bottom:22px;font-size:15px;color:var(--kyo-muted);line-height:1.82}
  .kyo-faq-a a{color:var(--kyo-accent);font-weight:700}

  /* LINK PILLS */
  .kyo-link-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center}
  .kyo-link-pill{padding:9px 20px;border:1.5px solid var(--kyo-border);border-radius:50px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kyo-dark);background:#fff;transition:all .3s;text-decoration:none}
  .kyo-link-pill:hover{border-color:var(--kyo-accent);color:var(--kyo-accent);background:var(--kyo-accent-pale);transform:translateY(-2px)}

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media(max-width:1024px){
    .kyo-pillar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .kyo-product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .kyo-trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  }
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .kyo-hero{min-height:65vh}
    .kyo-hero h1{font-size:35px}
    .kyo-glance-grid,.kyo-for-grid,.kyo-model-entry,.kyo-buyer-grid,.kyo-showroom-grid,.kyo-qa-grid,.kyo-answer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .kyo-pillar-grid,.kyo-trust-grid,.kyo-review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .kyo-product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
    .kyo-section{padding:56px 0}
    .kyo-final-cta{padding:40px 32px}
    .kyo-product-header-inner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
    .kyo-price-rung{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .kyo-price-rung-label{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
  }
  @media(max-width:600px){
    .kyo-product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .kyo-hero h1{font-size:30px}
    .kyo-container{padding:0 20px}
    .kyo-product-header{padding:32px 24px 0}
    .kyo-product-grid-wrap{padding:20px}
  }
</style>

