        <div class="kyo-pillar-card"><div class="kyo-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></div><h3>Premium Comfort Without Complexity</h3><p>Kyota is engineered for users who want a premium massage experience that is also comfortable and usable every day. The brand does not rely on overwhelming intensity to justify its price point. The result is a more sustainable daily-use comfort profile that improves over time.</p></div>
        <div class="kyo-pillar-card"><div class="kyo-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/></svg></div><h3>Showroom-Worthy Differences</h3><p>The differences between Kyota tiers become significantly more apparent when you sit in each chair back-to-back. Kyota is a brand where showroom comparison genuinely accelerates decision-making &mdash; because the feel, the lower-body work, and the AI scan experience must be felt to be fully appreciated.</p></div>
        <div class="kyo-pillar-card"><div class="kyo-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11.8 10.9c-2.27-.59-3-1.2-3-2.15 0-1.09 1.01-1.85 2.7-1.85 1.78 0 2.44.85 2.5 2.1h2.21c-.07-1.72-1.12-3.3-3.21-3.81V3h-3v2.16c-1.94.42-3.5 1.68-3.5 3.61 0 2.31 1.91 3.46 4.7 4.13 2.5.6 3 1.48 3 2.41 0 .69-.49 1.79-2.7 1.79-2.06 0-2.87-.92-2.98-2.1h-2.2c.12 2.19 1.76 3.42 3.68 3.83V21h3v-2.15c1.95-.37 3.5-1.5 3.5-3.55 0-2.84-2.43-3.81-4.7-4.4z"/></svg></div><h3>Premium Value Without Confusion</h3><p>Kyota occupies an honest price-to-quality position in the premium segment. Buyers who understand the brand can make a decision they feel confident in &mdash; not just a decision that felt good in the showroom for ten minutes. That long-term confidence is a measurable product of Kyota&rsquo;s clear model philosophy.</p></div>
