            <div class="kyo-showroom-row"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L11 14.17l7.59-7.59L20 8l-9 9z"/></svg><span>Kyota models available to try in person &mdash; specialist comparison guidance available at every visit</span></div>
            <div class="kyo-showroom-row"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.62 10.79c1.44 2.83 3.76 5.14 6.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"/></svg><span><a href="tel:+16692148889" style="color:var(--kyo-dark);font-weight:700">+1 (669) 214-8889</a></span></div>
