  {%- comment -%} ══════════ FAQ ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="kyo-section kyo-section-alt" id="kyo-faq">
    <div class="kyo-container-narrow">
      <div class="kyo-section-header center">
        <span class="kyo-section-label">Frequently Asked</span>
        <h2>Kyota Massage Chair <span class="kyo-underline">FAQ</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--kyo-border)">
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Are Kyota massage chairs worth it?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes &mdash; for buyers who want a premium massage chair with a clear, understandable upgrade path. Kyota&rsquo;s model ladder from the Genki M380 to the Nokori M980 Syner-D represents honest feature progression. The calf and foot work, 4D roller technology, and AI body scanning at the M900 tier deliver real value for daily users. The investment becomes most apparent after 30+ days of consistent daily use.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Kyota massage chair?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>The best Kyota chair depends on your body type, primary use case, and budget. For accessible daily use: the Genki M380. For 4D technology and strong calf work: the Yugana M780. For AI-guided personalization: the Hatsumei M900. For powerful 4D performance: the Joubu M880. For the flagship Kyota experience: the Nokori M980 Syner-D. Our specialists help buyers identify the right fit at our San Jose and Pleasanton showrooms.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Are Kyota massage chairs good?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes. Kyota massage chairs are consistently well-regarded by buyers who have researched and tried multiple premium brands. They are particularly praised for their clear model differentiation, strong calf and foot relief across the lineup, and meaningful technology at each tier. The AI body scanning on the M900 and Syner-D dual technology on the M980 are genuine, functional features &mdash; not marketing badges.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Are Kyota massage chairs reliable?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes. Kyota chairs are engineered for daily use and built to maintain consistent performance over time. Buyers who use their chair consistently report reliable performance from the calf work, roller mechanisms, and core massage programs without significant degradation. Buying from an authorized dealer with white-glove delivery and warranty support is the most important factor in long-term reliability.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Which Kyota model has the strongest calf and foot massage?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>The Joubu M880 and Nokori M980 are generally noted for the most assertive calf and foot experience in the Kyota lineup. The Yugana M780 also delivers strong lower-body work at its tier. The best way to evaluate calf intensity for your specific body is an in-person comparison &mdash; leg length, calf circumference, and personal pressure preference all affect how each model feels.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Kyota massage chairs in person?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries Kyota models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and at our Pleasanton location at Stoneridge Shopping Center. We strongly recommend trying Kyota in person before purchasing &mdash; the calf work intensity, AI body scan, and 4D roller feel cannot be fully conveyed by specifications or online reviews. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Where can I buy authentic Kyota massage chairs?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>House of Massage Chairs is an authorized Kyota dealer with showrooms in San Jose and Pleasanton, CA. Buying from an authorized specialist ensures genuine Kyota products, valid manufacturer warranties, professional white-glove delivery and setup, and specialist post-purchase support. Avoid unauthorized marketplace sellers who may not honor warranty claims or provide professional installation.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Do Kyota chairs come with warranty?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes. Kyota massage chairs include manufacturer-backed warranties covering parts, labor, and structural frame. Coverage terms vary by model tier and escalate with the investment level. HOMC coordinates all warranty claims on your behalf &mdash; you do not navigate that process alone.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>How much does a good Kyota massage chair cost?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Kyota positions across the accessible-premium to upper-flagship range. The Genki M380 is the most accessible entry into genuine Kyota quality. The Yugana M780 and Hatsumei M900 represent the mid-premium tier. The Joubu M880 and Nokori M980 Syner-D represent the upper-premium and flagship investment. Contact our team or visit a showroom for current pricing on each model.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between Kyota models?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>The Genki M380 is the accessible daily-use entry. The Yugana M780 adds 4D roller technology and stronger calf work. The Hatsumei M900 adds AI-guided body scanning with 4D massage. The Joubu M880 delivers powerful 4D performance with full-body coverage. The Nokori M980 Syner-D is the flagship with dual-roller Syner-D technology and the most elevated premium experience. Each model adds something meaningful &mdash; there are no filler tiers in the Kyota lineup.</p></div></div>
        <div class="kyo-faq-item"><div class="kyo-faq-q" onclick="kyoFaq(this)"><h3>Is Kyota a good brand compared with competitors?</h3><svg class="kyo-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="kyo-faq-a"><p>Yes &mdash; Kyota is a credible, well-positioned premium massage chair brand with genuine technology at each tier and one of the clearest upgrade ladders in the market. Compared with feature-dense brands like Osaki, Kyota prioritizes coherent model progression and strong lower-body relief. Compared with Japanese precision brands like Fujiiryoki, Kyota is more assertive in calf work and more direct in its technology positioning. For buyers who align with a clear premium ladder and strong lower-body focus, Kyota is one of the best choices in its segment.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

